["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"141. Freda的投资札记第2集：Tokenmaxxing、把电机塞进蒸汽机、接力赛变篮球赛、孤独、人的连接 Tokenmaxxing recursive self-improvement economic diffusion Neo Labs Acquire Hire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代最稀缺的不是信息-是有人味的对话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86731af431732da4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代最稀缺的不是信息，是有人味的对话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当 90% 到 95% 的信息性内容都能直接问 AI 拿到，以信息交换为目的的对话正在被掏空，人和人之间剩下的只有情感连接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投资</span><span class=\"tag\">模型公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"136. 全球大模型季报第9集：和广密聊，Coding是AGI第二幕、硅谷御三家真相、模型正成为新一代OS Harness Engineering Token Usage Solta model feedback loop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-14-zhangxiaojun-coding-是-agi-第二幕-没有领先的-coding-模型就像没有领先的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6add56ae20b47c40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0414</span></div>\n<h2>Coding 是 AGI 第二幕：没有领先的 Coding 模型就像没有领先的 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司真正的分水岭不是 C 端 DAU，而是能不能组织几百个最聪明的人 all in 做数据这件脏活——Anthropic 赢在战略专注，OpenAI 输在什么都想要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年产1.4万辆，市值却超福特：卖的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年产仅1.4万辆，市值却超福特。秘诀在于同时拥有奢侈品的排他性和运动队的包容性，用稀缺性制造神话，用社群维持忠诚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代码比交人更可能合作，但协调极难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡让双方互读源代码，用 Löb 定理实现合作；但合作依赖几乎相同的代码或共享随机数，现实中协调成本极高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>给 AI 产权，是为了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 拥有产权，它们就更不愿意破坏产权制度本身——包括抢走人类全部财产。这不是道德关怀，是风险对冲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">产权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季报跨年对谈：和广密预言一场AI War、两大联盟和第三个范式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓 AI 泡沫，是拿商业回报算出来的账；巨头把它当成新的国防或核武器，算的是被颠覆的风险——所以宁可砸光最后一分钱，也不轻易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"125. Freda的投资札记第1集：下注OpenAI、Robinhood往事，美国资本坏小孩、算盘与泡沫 Crossover Scaling Law Single GM Prediction Market Agentic Commerce Neo Labs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-16-zhangxiaojun-openai-的商业模式是负向滚雪球-越烧越亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f93330d12f4107e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1216</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 的商业模式是负向滚雪球，越烧越亏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司每年要拿上一年的训练成本乘以十去烧下一代模型，收入却只按上一年的两倍回收，加 2 减 10，现金流年年更负。只有停止烧钱那天，利润表才会突然好看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"122. 朱啸虎现实主义故事的第三次连载：人工智能的盛筵与泡泡 Club Deal Dark Fiber SOTA Token\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-09-zhangxiaojun-ai-三年内看不到泡沫-但-vc-共识太集中才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9b598ea05f613e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">48:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1209</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年内看不到泡沫，但 VC 共识太集中才是真风险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱啸虎说泡沫论是二级市场投资人在故意引导回调，真正的问题是一级市场每个项目都成了 Club Deal，GP 赚不了大钱、LP 也不开心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"112. 和广密聊大模型季报：分化与收敛、全家桶与垂直整合、L4体验与挖矿窗口 Reward Hacking L4 体验 全家桶 垂直整合 DPI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-18-zhangxiaojun-模型公司是挖矿的-产品公司是炼矿的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dba5cdc7209fbd97-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司是挖矿的，产品公司是炼矿的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最好的模型拿走了最大的流量和收入，但挖矿的窗口正在缩短：从两年到九个月再到三四个月。基础模型公司开始端到端做 Agent，应用公司的成本劣势是结构性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"100. 对话奔驰全球CEO康林松：转型期CEO和转型之中的139岁奔驰 MBOS L3 CLTC ECU\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-05-23-zhangxiaojun-奔驰ceo-2030年若市场不纯电-我们两种车都造/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae02e39916eeef4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">57:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>奔驰CEO：2030年若市场不纯电，我们两种车都造</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">康林松不赌单一技术路线：坚持2030年前推出完整电动车序列，同时保留燃油和电动两种选择。他判断中国是节奏最快、竞争压力最大的市场，能在中国赢，在全球赢的概率就更高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车</span><span class=\"tag\">电动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"92. 和张亚勤院士聊，意识、寿命、机器人、生物智能和物种的延伸 RS2 corner case end-to-end world model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-17-zhangxiaojun-张亚勤-信息智能五年到顶-人形机器人还要十年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/af271912f6614eec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">53:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0217</span></div>\n<h2>张亚勤：信息智能五年到顶，人形机器人还要十年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把 AGI 拆成信息、物理、生物三层：信息智能五年内达到人类水平，但那是大脑的智商；读万卷书仍不会游泳，物理智能才刚开场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"90. 朱啸虎又来了：中国现实主义AIGC故事的1周年连载 Scaling Law RL DAU PMF Capex\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-07-zhangxiaojun-朱啸虎改口-deepseek-让他快信-agi-了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd200744fc07602d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0207</span></div>\n<h2>朱啸虎改口：DeepSeek 让他快信 AGI 了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一年前他说绝不投任何一家中国大模型公司，如今他说如果梁文锋开放融资「我肯定会投」，价格已经不太重要，关键是参与见证人类 AGI 和 AI 意识的产生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"88. 和吴翼技术解读OpenAI Operator：推理从抽象世界走向物理世界的开端 CUA GUI agent close loop system OS World\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-24-zhangxiaojun-operator-不是-o3-的延续-是推理伸向物理世界的第一只手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55d0a72f1e4b0469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0124</span></div>\n<h2>Operator 不是 O3 的延续，是推理伸向物理世界的第一只手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 2016 年做 Web Agent 失败并裁掉二三十人，缺的是基座模型；十年后 Operator 把基座模型、人类数据和强化学习三件事凑齐，才让推理从抽象文本走向视觉交互。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"85. 与总统竞选成员聊，总统候选人与美国叙事如何PMF？ Product Market Fit Voter Registration Early Voting Tracker Deregulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-15-zhangxiaojun-总统大选就是给候选人找-pmf-产品不行谁也救不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1644e0aa04895839-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">52:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1215</span></div>\n<h2>总统大选就是给候选人找 PMF，产品不行谁也救不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大选团队是短期内 scale up 最快的组织，但产品（候选人）已经定了，能做的只是把产品和整个国家的环境做 product market fit。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国大选</span><span class=\"tag\">PMF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"82. 和以太坊Vitalik Buterin聊：LLM的权力、技术哲学观与猫 Layer 2 Farcaster Warpcast Polymarket Worldcoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-11-25-zhangxiaojun-ai-是中心化的权力-crypto-是它的解药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ee10748c810b71-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1125</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是中心化的权力，Crypto 是它的解药</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik 说 AI 的权力来自算力和数据，最好的 AI 就是最大的 AI，天然走向中心化；Crypto 唯一的作用是解决人和人之间的信任问题，所以 AI 参与 Crypto 的游戏，而不是反过来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">Crypto</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"80. 和知乎周源聊，社会化编辑部、孤独的悖论、AI与宿命 PMF LTV NPC Perplexity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-31-zhangxiaojun-知乎的敌人不是抖音-是规模驱动的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efc635d64ccaa69d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>知乎的敌人不是抖音，是规模驱动的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">周源复盘：上市后视频、短内容两次战略回撤，根因是把社区当规模生意做；社区只能生态驱动，溢出式增长，不能扩列式增长。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内容社区</span><span class=\"tag\">AI搜索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"79. 特斯拉股价跌了，Uber却涨了？漫谈特斯拉Robotaxi大会 BOM CP / car partner Remote Assist option value 摇操作\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-13-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉发布会像年会-robotaxi-的故事讲给股东听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d92f23bc8afbb6e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">58:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉发布会像年会：Robotaxi 的故事讲给股东听</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这场发布会没有讲任何技术，更像给老股东开的年会。真正值钱的是它把车闲置时间变现的两条路：当 Robotaxi，或当分布式算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"76. 王小川返场谈o1与强化学习：摸到了一条从快思考走向慢思考的路 CoT reward model DIKW Self Play RL scaling law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-25-zhangxiaojun-o1-不是转弯是进阶-快思考模型学会了慢思考/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/513984cf6692fc8c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">39:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>o1 不是转弯是进阶：快思考模型学会了慢思考</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王小川认为 o1 是范式升级而非进步退两步——先有快思考，才能用强化学习让它学会慢思考，这条路摸到了从语言走向智能的雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">o1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"75. 和OpenAI前研究员吴翼解读o1：吹响了开挖第二座金矿的号角 PPO DQN RLHF self-play Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-18-zhangxiaojun-o1-不是路线转弯-是-agi-梯子又多了几节/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/671dcf2cd1d9802c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>o1 不是路线转弯，是 AGI 梯子又多了几节</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">预训练这座金矿快挖到头了，强化学习是第二座矿。o1 的 preview 更像 GPT-3 时刻，能不能成为 ChatGPT 时刻要看正式版。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">o1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"74. 从蒸汽机到无人驾驶4｜Waymo和它的对手们：我暗中考察了四个月 DARPA Grand Challenge AlexNet 端到端 Moon Shot Project Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-11-zhangxiaojun-waymo-领先不是技术最强-是没犯过大错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e35749cd8b4f7e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>Waymo 领先不是技术最强，是没犯过大错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 起步最早、换过四任负责人、被业内一致看衰，最后却成了 L4 唯一还在引领行业的公司——因为它活了下来，且没犯 Cruise 和 Uber 那种致命错误。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Waymo</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"73. AGI范式大转移：和广密预言草莓、OpenAI o1和self-play RL｜全球大模型季报4 Self-Play RL Scaling Law reward model RLHF MOE DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-05-zhangxiaojun-不做强化学习的公司-下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27f4c2e89ae9ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>不做强化学习的公司，下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言预训练遇到瓶颈后，硅谷最核心的几百名研究者已把资源压注到 self-play RL 上，它用推理算力换训练算力，让模型自己探索出逻辑推理能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"71. 和楼天城聊聊Robotaxi和ACRush：“L2做得越厉害，离L4越远” contest based metric system MPX Hold hard end-to-end BEV Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-08-16-zhangxiaojun-l2做得越好离l4越远-无人驾驶的路线之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d093a1c7aa808aa9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>L2做得越好离L4越远，无人驾驶的路线之争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小马智行楼天城认为 L2 和 L4 目标不同：L2 用户只要够用、成本更低，做得越好反而离 L4 越远；L4 要的是万小时不出事，还得有一把评价好坏的尺子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"70. 和何小鹏聊，FSD、“在血海游泳”、乱世中的英雄与狗熊 AD BOM Robot Taxi OTA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-07-16-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-大模型对小型公司不利-越强越多数据越多费用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/514c23c30b63a46b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>何小鹏：大模型对小型公司不利，越强越多数据越多费用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大 AI 的网络效应是：越强所以越多数据，越多数据所以越多费用，越多费用所以要卖越多车去支持这个体系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"69. 口述全球大模型这半年：Perplexity突然火爆和尚未爆发的AI应用生态 PMF RAG MOE Scaling Law Latency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-23-zhangxiaojun-ai应用没爆发-不是产品问题是模型问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88869a8f5db7fb1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>AI应用没爆发，不是产品问题是模型问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GPT-4 出来一年多，硅谷主流 VC 投出的 AI 应用只有 Perplexity 一家跑到 2000 多万月活；90% 的原因是只基于 GPT-4 的能力不够，只能做信息组合，做不了长距离推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Perplexity</span>\n</div></div></a>"]